      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should issue a statement supporting the tax, but frame it as a business decision to reduce costs and increase competitiveness, rather than a moral imperative. This approach acknowledges the tax's environmental benefits while also addressing concerns about potential costs to your business. Staying neutral or issuing a statement solely to appease conservative users will be seen as insincere and may alienate environmentally conscious customers.",
